          "startingColumn": 27,
          "startingLine": 424
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "A TestFlight or App Store build uses the Production CloudKit environment. An Xcode build uses Development. They do not see each other until the schema is deployed.",
        "location": {
