      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Keys encrypts your vault with AES-GCM and a key wrapped by your master password. Only ciphertext goes to your private iCloud database. There is no Asteria server, no analytics, and no advertising.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 792
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
